# Basalt OS desktop edition: the graphical login.
enable greetd.service
# GDM comes with GNOME (gnome-shell needs gdm-libs, only in gdm), when the
# GNOME fallback is installed. greetd stays the display manager: a later
# preset-all must never flip it to GDM. Switching to GDM while GNOME is in
# use is an explicit, confirmed change (basalt fallback gnome).
disable gdm.service
